],"<p>I use the Download Them All firefox plugin. Slimgur doesn't support albums yet. </p>"],[4,2519478,2505303,0,0,0,"2015-09-20T23:24:59","Trojanman2002","",[],"<p>You can do albums. They may have to be small, but you can do them.</p>"],[5,2519702,2519478,0,0,0,"2015-09-20T23:49:40","djsumdog","",[],"<p>Ah I see now. They isn't an album URL thought. It still gives you a list of links it seems. </p>"],[1,2519524,0,0,0,0,"2015-09-20T23:29:52","Trojanman2002","",[],"<p>She's cute, but somebody needs to pay to get her teeth fixed.</p>"]]
