[[0,525420,0,10,1,9,"2015-09-19T18:24:41","Phuffu","",[],"","Thighbrows, this article is really funny","http://mic.com/articles/125275/thighbrow-is-the-new-trend-replacing-thigh-gap-and-its-something-we-can-actually-get-behind?utm_source=policymicFB&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=WHFacebook","fatpeoplehate"],[1,2503684,0,7,0,7,"2015-09-19T18:37:16","newguynewguynewguy","",[],"<p>Jesus fuck the American public is so fucking stupid. Fuck the kardashians and anything they pimp. Thighbrow - this is the dumbest thing I've ever been exposed to.</p>"],[1,2504127,0,9,0,9,"2015-09-19T19:14:20","allaboutthattreble","",[],"<p>&quot;The resulting photos are a giant 'fuck you!' to the tyranny of the thigh gap.&quot;</p>\n<p>Riiiiight, except that I have a thigh gap, and a thighbrow. Your move fatties.</p>"],[1,2505360,0,2,0,2,"2015-09-19T21:12:22","wmeth","",[],"<p>And yet, all those pics were of legit &quot;curvy&quot; women. We'll fight the tyranny of the thigh gap by showing women who aren't fat??? \r</p>\n<p>On another note: brace yourselves. The tublrinos are going to be posting thigh brow pics. Keep a vomit bucket handy. </p>"],[1,2506009,0,0,0,0,"2015-09-19T22:13:52","TRlGGERED","",[],"<blockquote>\n<p>accompanied by <strong>body-positive hashtags like #NoThighGap</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>So it's body positive to bash women who naturally have a gap between their thighs? Mmk.</p>"],[1,2506027,0,1,0,1,"2015-09-19T22:15:14","shortshorts","",[],"<p>What pisses me off the most is the guy the who this has a masters from NYU...wtf are they teaching there??</p>"],[1,2507954,0,0,0,0,"2015-09-20T01:06:17","physicscat","",[],"<p>The Kardashians have made popular culture so vapid, shallow, and skanky. </p>"],[1,2508257,0,0,0,0,"2015-09-20T01:37:52","marquise","",[],"<p>TIL: There are a lot of stupid women out there who support this shit. </p>"]]
